{"parentUuid":"d84275a5-8ee2-40aa-abfa-b6f13cff6eee","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01Nm6E2PtoiQrKosfaaXx5oU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PPLXsVq6RepkjmFFiHKnuR","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"gh pr create --title \"Stop stale ACTIVE sessions from inheriting another session's committed files\" --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n\nA recent ACTIVE session that did no real work (e.g. a Codex shell where the user typed `exit` hours ago — phase still ACTIVE, `LastInteractionTime` within 24h, no `FilesTouched`, transcript only contains a startup banner) was being condensed onto a commit authored entirely by a different ACTIVE session and inheriting that commit's file list via `filterFilesTouched`'s evidence-of-work fallback.\n\nThe trigger was a hole in `shouldCondenseWithOverlapCheck`: the read-only-skip clause only fired when `sessionsWithCommittedFiles > 0`. When the working session's `state.FilesTouched` on disk happened to be empty at gate time (e.g. a Stop hook hadn't fired yet for an in-flight turn), `sessionsWithCommittedFiles` dropped to `0` and the stale session slipped through.\n\nThe fix adds two evidence-of-work signals checked alongside the existing condition:\n\n- **`hasTranscriptGrowth`** — live transcript file size is greater than the size captured at the last condensation (`state.CheckpointTranscriptSize`). Plain `os.Stat`, agent-agnostic, so it works for any agent that writes a transcript file (including Vogon, which doesn't implement `TranscriptAnalyzer`).\n- **`hasShadowContributions`** — `state.StepCount > 0`, i.e. SaveStep ran since the last condensation. A session whose Stop hook fired and populated the shadow branch must still condense even if its `state.FilesTouched` got cleared by a subsequent flow.\n\nA session with empty `FilesTouched` is now skipped if **either** another session claims the commit **or** this session has no transcript growth and no shadow contributions.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] new regression test `TestPostCommit_StaleActiveSession_DoesNotInheritOtherSessionFiles` (added skipped in c2dd73a22, unskipped here) — passes\n- [x] existing `TestReadOnlySession_ActiveDuringCommit_NotCondensed` and `TestReadOnlySession_ActiveAcrossMultipleCommits` — pass\n- [x] vogon canary E2E (58 tests) — all pass\n- [x] full strategy + integration suites — pass\n- [x] `mise run fmt && mise run lint` — clean\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -5","description":"Open PR"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":416,"cache_read_input_tokens":454259,"output_tokens":976,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":416,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":976,"cache_read_input_tokens":454259,"cache_creation_input_tokens":416,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":416},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CajNkcSXy89YTnp5qHrhv","type":"assistant","uuid":"02c62296-586d-4015-b36a-9f920ef3ea00","timestamp":"2026-05-05T11:53:32.880Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli","sessionId":"ba6294b0-a5fd-44fd-9d04-b07f4e2227ed","version":"2.1.126","gitBranch":"soph/checkpoint-session-bug"}
